This is actually a much bigger deal than most people think, because when your hands stay on the keyboard, you stay in the flow.

30
00:02:53,358 --> 00:03:00,740
但如果你每隔几秒就得把手移到鼠标上，就会打断心流，并迫使你的大脑进行上下文切换。
But if you have to move your hand to the mouse every couple of seconds, it breaks the flow and forces your brain to contact switch.

