00:15:49,102 --> 00:16:03,108
我构建这个文件的方法不是手写所有内容，而是每当我看到智能体做错事情时，我会纠正它，
并要求它记住不要再犯同样的错误，把这些学习内容存入这个记忆文件中。
The way I built this file is not by writing everything by hand, but rather that every time I saw the agent doing something wrong,
I would correct it and ask it to remember to not make the same mistake again by storing the learning into this memory file.

